 ## Background
-Originated in "Compact 3D Scene Representation via Self-Organizing Gaussian Grids" by Morgenstern et al. [S1]. The method leverages the spatial coherence of Gaussian splats to treat SH coefficients as image-like data. The VQ variant was proposed in "Hybrid Compression Method for Trained 3D Gaussian Splatting Models Based on VQ and HEVC" [S2].
